  "requires_runtime": {
    "node": ">=22",
    "browser": "optional — only if the `playwright` MCP server is enabled. An installed Edge, Chrome, Firefox or WebKit; nothing is bundled. Not needed on hosts with built-in browser tools (VS Code Copilot).",
    "notes": "The bundled MCP configuration pins Flint 0.3.0, Replicate MCP 0.9.0, and Playwright MCP 0.0.78 exactly and passes `--prefer-offline` to every `npx` invocation. npm checks its cache first and may contact only the registry configured by the user's environment when an exact package is absent. The plugin never probes an alternate registry, overrides the configured registry, or resolves `latest`. Install the configuration at `.vscode/mcp.json`; VS Code does not read a workspace-root `.mcp.json`. Replicate is optional and requires `REPLICATE_API_TOKEN`; Playwright is optional on hosts with built-in browser tools."
  },
